# Where run_webkit.py drops a packaged plate so the page can fetch it.
#
# `sw_GetFileStream` hands the page a URL rather than the bytes, so the zip has to be
# reachable over HTTP - the harness copies it under the directory it is already serving,
# which is THIS one. It first went in resources/web/, one level too deep, and the file
# showed up untracked on the next commit.
_bridge_files/
